  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">the proposed project aims to address systemic gaps in addressing the increasing sexual and gender-based violence against women and girls in Sri Lanka, by adopting multi-focused interventions and actions targeting specific stakeholders; and advocating on specific rights issues which hinder the enjoyment of women&#x2019;s rights in full.</narrative>
